  "title": "Chemical Apple Pie (No-Apple Apple Pie)",
  "description": "This is a recipe for apple pie made without apples. Fool your tastebuds with chemistry — the apples in this delicious pie are really buttery crackers.",
  "authors": [
    "John Pile"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-09-13T17:15:26-04:00",
